  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In the given logical circuit, all logic gates are NAND gate.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0058_9aa667da1c10.png\" style=\"width: 369px; height: 125px;\" /></p><p>Here, the inputs&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;are inverted using NOT gate (made using NAND gate), then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are applied as inputs in other NAND gate.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>A</mi></menclose></mfenced><mo>=</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi></menclose></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>B</mi></menclose><mo>=</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>B</mi></menclose></math></p><p>Output at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi></menclose><mo>.</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>B</mi></menclose></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></math>.</p><p>The above boolean expression is for OR gate.</p><p>Truth table of OR gate is&nbsp;</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 300px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>The output waveform is shown below.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\ot4_0058_5b86833c4f9a.png\" style=\"width: 287px; height: 130px;\" /></p>"
  }
